WEBVTT

00:07.738 --> 00:09.174
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.261 --> 00:10.695
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.782 --> 00:12.391
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.478 --> 00:14.217
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.304 --> 00:17.478
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.564 --> 00:19.280
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.304 --> 00:21.608
Kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.695 --> 00:23.414
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.478 --> 00:25.304
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.391 --> 00:27.309
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.348 --> 00:29.651
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.738 --> 00:31.584
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.608 --> 00:33.217
kids: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
孩子们：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.304 --> 00:34.956
All:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.043 --> 00:37.391
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.478 --> 00:39.304
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.391 --> 00:40.695
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.782 --> 00:42.521
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.608 --> 00:45.217
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.304 --> 00:47.521
[flute plays]
[长笛演奏]

00:47.608 --> 00:48.825
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:50.651 --> 00:53.521
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:53.608 --> 01:01.043
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:01.130 --> 01:02.217
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

01:02.304 --> 01:03.043
All right, Karen.
好吧，凯伦。

01:03.130 --> 01:05.174
I'm off to go shopping.
我要去购物了。

01:05.261 --> 01:06.521
[whistling]
[吹口哨]

01:06.608 --> 01:07.607
Oh!
哦！

01:07.651 --> 01:09.217
- Uh... ew!
- 呃...呃！

01:09.304 --> 01:10.738
What is that?
那是什么？

01:10.825 --> 01:11.912
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

01:12.000 --> 01:13.174
Ahh!
啊！

01:13.261 --> 01:14.174
Ahh!
啊！

01:14.261 --> 01:16.738
[groans]
[呻吟]

01:16.825 --> 01:19.651
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

01:19.738 --> 01:21.825
Huh?
- Hey, over here.
啊？
- 嘿，在这里。

01:21.912 --> 01:23.130
[jazzy music]
[爵士乐]

01:23.217 --> 01:25.348
- So, uh, you got the goods?
- 那么，呃，你拿到货了吗？

01:25.435 --> 01:27.130
- Of course.
- 当然。

01:27.217 --> 01:29.130
I always deliver.
我总是送货。

01:29.217 --> 01:31.043
- Hee-hee.
- 嘻嘻。

01:31.130 --> 01:33.261
Eee!
哎呀！

01:33.348 --> 01:36.000
- Pleasure doing
business with you.
- 做事的乐趣
与您开展业务。

01:36.087 --> 01:38.348
- Likewise, my shady friend.
- 同样，我的阴暗朋友。

01:38.435 --> 01:39.564
So same time next...
那么接下来的同一时间...

01:39.651 --> 01:42.825
[groans]
[呻吟]

01:42.912 --> 01:46.348
[accordion music]
[手风琴音乐]

01:46.435 --> 01:47.435
[groans]
[呻吟]

01:47.521 --> 01:50.087
I'm here for the formula.
我是来求公式的

01:50.174 --> 01:52.564
Hand it over, and nobody gets...
交给别人吧，没有人能得到...

01:52.651 --> 01:53.564
[groans]
[呻吟]

01:53.651 --> 01:55.391
- Ew.
- 呃。

01:55.478 --> 01:58.478
I seem to have stepped in
some revolting substance.
我仿佛已经踏入
一些令人反感的物质。

01:58.564 --> 01:59.651
No matter.
不管。

01:59.738 --> 02:01.478
- Ouch.
- 哎哟。

02:01.564 --> 02:03.912
Ouch.
哎哟。

02:06.738 --> 02:10.564
[groaning]
[呻吟]

02:10.651 --> 02:13.174
Honey, I'm home.
亲爱的，我回来了。

02:13.261 --> 02:15.261
- Tough day at work, dear?
- 亲爱的，今天工作辛苦吗？

02:15.348 --> 02:16.217
- Yes.
- 是的。

02:16.304 --> 02:18.304
Everybody stepped on me again.
大家又踩到我身上了。

02:18.391 --> 02:19.738
- Oh.
- 哦。

02:19.825 --> 02:23.000
Well, I know what'll
cheer up my little man.
好吧，我知道会发生什么
让我的小男人高兴起来。

02:23.087 --> 02:24.825
Let's dance those blues away.
让我们一起跳舞消除那些忧郁吧。

02:24.912 --> 02:26.564
- Oh, boy!
- 哦，孩子！

02:26.651 --> 02:28.174
[air horn blares]
[气喇叭声]

02:28.261 --> 02:29.651
- Oh, yeah.
- 哦，是的。

02:29.738 --> 02:30.651
Go, Sheldon.
走吧，谢尔顿。

02:30.738 --> 02:32.261
Ha-ha!
哈哈！

02:32.348 --> 02:35.956
- You were right, Karen,
I feel better already.
- 你是对的，凯伦，
我已经感觉好多了。

02:36.043 --> 02:38.261
I've got boogie fever!
我得了布吉热！

02:38.348 --> 02:39.825
[groans]
[呻吟]

02:39.912 --> 02:43.695
- We haven't danced like
this since our wedding night.
-我们没有像这样跳舞
这是从我们新婚之夜开始的。

02:43.782 --> 02:45.478
- [laughs] Whoo!
- [笑] 哇！

02:45.564 --> 02:46.651
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

02:46.738 --> 02:50.348
- [vocalizing]
- [发声]

02:50.435 --> 02:51.348
- Plankton?
- 浮游生物？

02:51.435 --> 02:53.087
Oh, no.
哦，不。

02:53.174 --> 02:54.435
Pardon me.
Pardon me.
对不起。
对不起。

02:54.521 --> 02:56.391
Plankton?
浮游生物？

02:56.478 --> 02:58.217
Plankton,
are you there, sweetie?
浮游生物，
你在吗，亲爱的？

02:58.304 --> 02:59.303
Excuse me.
打扰一下。

02:59.348 --> 03:00.261
- Oh.
- 哦。

03:00.348 --> 03:01.217
- Plankton?
- 浮游生物？

03:01.304 --> 03:03.912
[grunts]
There you are.
[咕哝]
你就在那里。

03:04.000 --> 03:05.435
At least part of you.
至少是你的一部分。

03:05.521 --> 03:06.695
- That's it!
- 就是这样！

03:06.782 --> 03:09.695
I'm not getting
stepped on anymore.
我没有得到
不再踩了。

03:09.782 --> 03:11.261
Take me to my lab.
带我去我的实验室。

03:11.348 --> 03:12.521
- Sure.
- 当然。

03:12.608 --> 03:16.738
But let's find
the rest of you first.
但我们要找到
你们其他人先。

03:16.825 --> 03:20.564
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

03:20.651 --> 03:23.435
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

03:23.521 --> 03:24.956
[bell dings]
[铃声]

03:25.043 --> 03:29.391
[grunts] Foot Deterrent,
Version 1.1, commence test.
[咕噜声]脚威慑，
1.1版本，开始测试。

03:29.478 --> 03:32.261
[groans]
[呻吟]

03:32.348 --> 03:34.391
Not quite there.
不完全在那里。

03:37.956 --> 03:41.435
- Foot Deterrent, laser thingy.
- 脚步威慑，激光之物。

03:41.521 --> 03:44.478
[sighs] Might as well
get this over with.
[叹气]也可以
把这件事结束吧。

03:44.564 --> 03:45.825
[laser pings]
[激光脉冲]

03:45.912 --> 03:46.825
[machine hisses]
[机器嘶嘶声]

03:46.912 --> 03:48.217
What?
什么？

03:48.304 --> 03:49.435
Yes.
是的。

03:49.521 --> 03:50.651
I'm invincible!
我无敌了！

03:50.738 --> 03:51.608
Ohh-ohh-ohh-ohh.
哦哦哦哦。

03:51.695 --> 03:52.694
Ah!
啊!

03:52.738 --> 03:57.391
[laser blasts]
[激光爆炸]

03:57.478 --> 03:59.738
Ow.
噢。

03:59.825 --> 04:02.738
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

04:02.825 --> 04:04.261
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

04:04.348 --> 04:06.869
All right, time for a field test
好的，是时候进行实地测试了

04:06.956 --> 04:10.956
in T-minus 3, 2, 1.
在 T-减 3, 2, 1 中。

04:11.043 --> 04:13.521
- Huh?
[laser blasts]
- 啊？
[激光爆炸]

04:13.608 --> 04:14.608
- Hmm.
- 唔。

04:14.695 --> 04:15.956
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

04:16.043 --> 04:17.738
- My foot!
- 我的脚！

04:17.825 --> 04:19.000
Ouch.
Ouch.
哎哟。
哎哟。

04:19.087 --> 04:21.521
Ouch.
- [cackles]
哎哟。
- [咯咯笑]

04:21.608 --> 04:24.348
Take that,
you high-stepping ham!
就拿那个来说，
你这个高高在上的火腿！

04:24.435 --> 04:25.695
Huh?
啊？

04:25.782 --> 04:26.695
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

04:26.782 --> 04:28.261
- Oh, boy.
- 哦，男孩。

04:28.348 --> 04:31.738
Time to stop
those big metal stompers.
是时候停下来了
那些大金属踩踏器。

04:31.825 --> 04:33.348
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

04:33.435 --> 04:35.869
Hmm?
唔？

04:35.956 --> 04:39.261
[grunting]
Hwah!
[咕噜声]
哇！

04:39.348 --> 04:41.521
Hee-yah!
嘿呀！

04:41.608 --> 04:43.130
[laser blasts]
[激光爆炸]

04:43.217 --> 04:45.217
- Plankton, what in
tarnation are you doing?
- 浮游生物，什么在
你在做什么？

04:45.304 --> 04:47.478
You almost barbecued
my dang paw.
你差点就烤了
我的爪子。

04:47.564 --> 04:48.825
- Duh.
- 呃。

04:48.912 --> 04:50.521
That was the point.
这就是重点。

04:50.608 --> 04:53.564
But hey, what was that
"hiyah" stuff you just did?
但是，嘿，那是什么？
你刚刚做了“嗨”的事情吗？

04:53.651 --> 04:56.825
- Well, that was just good,
old-fashioned self-defense.
- 嗯，那很好，
老式的自卫。

04:56.912 --> 04:59.521
You know, karate.
你知道，空手道。

04:59.608 --> 05:02.304
Looks like you could use
a little self-defense too.
看起来你可以使用
也有一点自卫。

05:02.391 --> 05:05.695
Why don't you swing by my dome
so I can show you some moves?
你为什么不在我的圆顶附近荡来荡去
所以我可以给你展示一些动作？

05:05.782 --> 05:10.348
- Anything to stop the stomping.
- 任何可以阻止跺脚的东西。

05:10.435 --> 05:12.956
Hmm?
唔？

05:13.043 --> 05:14.348
- Huh?
- 啊？

05:14.435 --> 05:16.651
[sighs]
[叹气]

05:16.738 --> 05:18.217
[mystical music]
[神秘音乐]

05:18.304 --> 05:20.782
- All right,
Plankton, come on out.
- 好吧，
浮游生物，出来吧。

05:20.869 --> 05:21.869
- Mm.
- 毫米。

05:21.956 --> 05:25.087
I make this gi look good.
我让这件道服看起来不错。

05:25.174 --> 05:28.000
- Now bow to your sensei.
- 现在向你的老师鞠躬。

05:28.087 --> 05:31.130
- Plankton bows to no one.
- 浮游生物不向任何人低头。

05:31.217 --> 05:32.695
- Huh?
- Hiyah.
- 啊？
-嗨。

05:32.782 --> 05:33.651
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

05:33.738 --> 05:34.737
- Good.
- 好的。

05:34.782 --> 05:36.782
Now we may begin.
现在我们可以开始了。

05:36.869 --> 05:40.738
We must first gauge your
current level of self-defense.
我们必须首先衡量你的
目前的自卫水平。

05:40.825 --> 05:41.738
Think fast!
快想想吧！

05:41.825 --> 05:42.435
- Think what?
- 想想什么？

05:42.521 --> 05:44.348
Ouch!
哎哟!

05:44.435 --> 05:47.261
Now I know why
they call it a sneaker.
现在我知道为什么了
他们称之为运动鞋。

05:47.348 --> 05:50.087
- Maybe something
a little gentler.
- 也许有什么
温柔一点。

05:50.174 --> 05:52.912
- [grunting] Whoa!
- [咕哝] 哇！

05:53.000 --> 05:54.738
I can't flip like you.
我不能像你一样翻转。

05:54.825 --> 05:55.824
Only flop.
只能失败。

05:55.869 --> 05:56.782
- OK.
- 好的。

05:56.869 --> 05:58.956
How 'bout these?
这些怎么样？

05:59.043 --> 06:00.608
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

06:00.695 --> 06:01.738
- Ouch!
- 哎呀！

06:01.825 --> 06:03.261
- Huh.
- 嗯。

06:03.348 --> 06:05.391
Seems like you lack
the fundamentals.
看来你缺乏
基本面。

06:05.478 --> 06:08.738
What you need
is some basic training.
你需要什么
是一些基础训练。

06:08.825 --> 06:12.956
- [grunts] Okey-dokey,
furry lady.
- [咕哝] 好吧，
毛茸茸的女士。

06:13.043 --> 06:17.956
[funky music]
[时髦音乐]

06:18.043 --> 06:20.348
Hyah, hyah, hyah, hyah, hyah!
哈、哈、哈、哈、哈！

06:20.435 --> 06:21.825
Ow.
噢。

06:21.912 --> 06:26.087
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:26.174 --> 06:30.825
[grunts]
Ah!
[咕哝]
啊！

06:30.912 --> 06:32.912
[grunts]
Ha-ha!
[咕哝]
哈哈！

06:33.000 --> 06:34.521
Augh!
啊啊！

06:34.608 --> 06:36.521
Heh-heh-heh.
呵呵。

06:36.608 --> 06:37.348
Hiyah!
嗨！

06:37.435 --> 06:39.217
Hee-hee.
嘻嘻。

06:39.304 --> 06:43.869
[glass squeaking]
[玻璃吱吱作响]

06:43.956 --> 06:46.869
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

06:46.956 --> 06:48.651
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

06:48.738 --> 06:49.869
[mystical music]
[神秘音乐]

06:49.956 --> 06:52.435
- Now that you've
mastered the basics,
- 现在你已经
掌握了基础知识，

06:52.521 --> 06:55.912
I reckon you're ready to
spar with a real partner.
我想你已经准备好了
与真正的伙伴进行对决。

06:56.000 --> 06:57.564
- Hi, Plankton!
- 嗨，浮游生物！

06:57.651 --> 06:58.738
- SpongeBob?
- 海绵宝宝？

06:58.825 --> 07:00.391
- Don't you worry.
- 别担心。

07:00.478 --> 07:02.000
I'll go easy on ya.
我会轻松对待你的。

07:02.087 --> 07:04.217
Foam sparring boots.
泡沫陪练靴。

07:04.304 --> 07:06.391
- I can't promise
I'll do the same.
-我不能保证
我也会这样做。

07:06.478 --> 07:08.651
- Bow to your opponents.
- 向你的对手鞠躬。

07:08.738 --> 07:10.695
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

07:10.782 --> 07:11.825
- Now fight!
- 现在战斗！

07:11.912 --> 07:13.869
- Wah!
- 哇！

07:13.956 --> 07:15.564
- Hmm?
- Yah!
- 唔？
- 啊！

07:15.651 --> 07:16.650
- Ah!
- 啊！

07:16.695 --> 07:17.608
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

07:17.695 --> 07:19.217
[groans]
[呻吟]

07:19.304 --> 07:21.000
- That was pretty
good, Plankton.
- 那很漂亮
好，浮游生物。

07:21.087 --> 07:22.608
But remember to
keep your guard up.
但请记住
保持警惕。

07:22.695 --> 07:24.478
- It's no use.
- 这没有用。

07:24.564 --> 07:27.782
I'm just too small to
avoid being stepped on.
我只是太小了
避免被踩到。

07:27.869 --> 07:29.478
- Hmm.
- 唔。

07:29.564 --> 07:33.564
But in karate, your
greatest weakness may also
但在空手道中，你的
最大的弱点也可能是

07:33.651 --> 07:35.782
be your greatest strength.
成为你最大的力量。

07:35.869 --> 07:37.478
- Yeah.
- 是的。

07:37.564 --> 07:40.825
But in "rea-li-tay," that
doesn't make any sense!
但在“real-li-tay”中，
没有任何意义！

07:40.912 --> 07:42.651
- Allow me to demonstrate.
- 请允许我演示一下。

07:42.738 --> 07:45.435
SpongeBob,
give me the old roundhouse.
海绵宝宝，
把旧的圆屋给我。

07:45.521 --> 07:47.000
- Wah!
- 哇！

07:47.087 --> 07:48.498
- Your opponent's
momentum can be used...
- 你对手的
可以使用动量...

07:48.521 --> 07:49.391
- Huh?
- 啊？

07:49.478 --> 07:50.956
[groans]
[呻吟]

07:51.043 --> 07:53.782
- against them,
no matter your size.
- 反对他们，
无论您的身材如何。

07:53.869 --> 07:55.043
You OK, SpongeBob?
你还好吗，海绵宝宝？

07:55.130 --> 07:58.000
- I would bow to you If I could.
- 如果可以的话，我会向你鞠躬。

07:58.087 --> 08:00.130
Ouch.
哎哟。

08:00.217 --> 08:02.825
- That was incredible!
- 太不可思议了！

08:02.912 --> 08:04.435
Let me try.
让我试试。

08:04.521 --> 08:06.738
- Visualize the technique.
- 可视化该技术。

08:06.825 --> 08:10.217
Grab, twist,
and let gravity do the rest.
抓住、扭转、
让重力完成剩下的工作。

08:10.304 --> 08:11.303
- Shut up.
- 住口。

08:11.348 --> 08:12.912
You're distracting me.
你分散了我的注意力。

08:13.000 --> 08:14.348
[mystical music]
[神秘音乐]

08:14.435 --> 08:17.174
[inhales and exhales]
[吸气和呼气]

08:17.261 --> 08:18.956
- Hwah!
- 哇！

08:19.043 --> 08:20.956
[funky music]
[时髦音乐]

08:21.043 --> 08:23.087
- Hiyah!
- Ugh!
-嗨！
- 呃！

08:23.174 --> 08:24.348
- I did it!
