17:01.738 --> 17:04.391
[mumbling]
[咕哝]

17:04.478 --> 17:06.825
- Must be shy about
his first day.
- 一定是害羞了
他的第一天。

17:06.912 --> 17:09.695
If you want to work out, I'd
be happy to help train you.
如果你想锻炼的话我会
很乐意帮助培训您。

17:09.782 --> 17:11.217
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

17:11.304 --> 17:12.478
Heh, heh.
呵呵。

17:12.564 --> 17:17.261
Yeah, maybe I
could use a few pointers.
是的，也许我
可以使用一些指针。

17:17.348 --> 17:19.478
- Let's just try lifting
some free weights.
- 让我们尝试举重
一些自由重量。

17:19.564 --> 17:22.348
- Look, Larry, I'm doing it!
- 看，拉里，我正在做！

17:22.435 --> 17:24.174
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

17:24.261 --> 17:25.391
Wah!
哇！

17:25.478 --> 17:26.825
- [groans] Sponge...
- [呻吟]海绵……

17:26.912 --> 17:28.651
- [grunts]
- Huh?
- [咕哝]
- 啊？

17:28.738 --> 17:30.521
Hey!
- [grunting]
嘿！
- [咕哝]

17:30.608 --> 17:31.869
[laughs]
[笑]

17:31.956 --> 17:34.174
- No stealing
the free weights, bro.
- 禁止偷窃
自由重量，兄弟。

17:34.261 --> 17:36.608
- Well, are they free or not?
- 嗯，它们免费吗？

17:36.695 --> 17:39.043
[grunts]
[咕哝]

17:39.130 --> 17:41.217
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

17:41.304 --> 17:45.217
I've never met anyone
as workout-averse as you.
我从未见过任何人
和你一样厌恶锻炼。

17:45.304 --> 17:47.391
I just don't know
how to motivate you.
我只是不知道
如何激励你。

17:47.478 --> 17:48.521
- Ooh.
- 哦。

17:48.608 --> 17:50.564
I know how to motivate him.
我知道如何激励他。

17:50.651 --> 17:53.087
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

17:53.174 --> 17:54.564
Huh? Huh?
啊？啊？

17:54.651 --> 17:56.261
- Ooh.
- 哦。

17:56.348 --> 18:00.261
Money, money, money,
money, money, money.
钱，钱，钱，
钱，钱，钱。

18:00.348 --> 18:01.478
[grunts]
Money!
[咕哝]
钱！

18:01.564 --> 18:02.782
Money!
Money!
钱！
钱！

18:02.869 --> 18:03.868
Money!
- Whoa.
钱！
- 哇哦。

18:03.912 --> 18:05.348
Nice trick, little dude.
好技巧，小家伙。

18:05.435 --> 18:06.738
- That's nothing.
- 那没什么。

18:06.825 --> 18:10.564
You should see how I get
him to take his pills.
你应该看看我是如何得到的
他服药。

18:10.651 --> 18:15.521
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

18:15.608 --> 18:18.087
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

18:18.174 --> 18:18.695
[cash register dings]
[收银机叮叮声]

18:18.782 --> 18:19.695
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

18:19.782 --> 18:22.869
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

18:22.956 --> 18:25.174
[cash register dinging]
[收银机叮叮声]

18:25.261 --> 18:30.000
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

18:32.348 --> 18:33.651
[laughs]
[笑]

18:33.738 --> 18:34.912
Yeah!
是的！

18:36.956 --> 18:39.478
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

18:39.564 --> 18:40.912
- Whew.
- 呼。

18:41.000 --> 18:43.521
That was one heck of a workout.
那真是一次艰苦的锻炼。

18:43.608 --> 18:47.608
Time to see what 168
straight hours of exercise
是时候看看什么了 168
连续几个小时的锻炼

18:47.695 --> 18:50.478
does to the body.
对身体有影响。

18:50.564 --> 18:51.738
- Ahh.
- 啊。

18:51.825 --> 18:54.435
[gasps]
[喘气]

18:54.521 --> 18:55.695
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

18:55.782 --> 18:59.130
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

18:59.217 --> 18:59.956
- Hey!
- 嘿！

19:00.043 --> 19:01.651
What's the deal, Larry?
这是怎么回事，拉里？

19:01.738 --> 19:03.217
Why ain't I ripped?
为啥我没撕？

19:03.304 --> 19:06.261
- Fitness is a
lifelong journey, bro.
- 健身是一个
一生的旅程，兄弟。

19:06.348 --> 19:08.695
Can't change your
physique in a week.
无法改变你的
一周内体质。

19:08.782 --> 19:10.174
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

19:10.261 --> 19:11.564
- [grunts] Ah.
- [咕哝]啊。

19:11.651 --> 19:12.956
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

19:13.043 --> 19:15.564
See you bros in the sauna.
兄弟们桑拿见。

19:15.651 --> 19:17.738
- Hmm?
- 唔？

19:17.825 --> 19:19.912
[groans]
[呻吟]

19:20.000 --> 19:23.261
No one can change
their physique, eh?
没有人可以改变
他们的体质吧？

19:23.348 --> 19:24.782
Hee-hee-hee-hee.
嘻嘻嘻。

19:24.869 --> 19:25.738
[laid back music]
[悠闲的音乐]

19:25.825 --> 19:28.608
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

19:28.695 --> 19:30.348
[rock music]
[摇滚乐]

19:30.435 --> 19:31.434
Huh?
啊？

19:31.478 --> 19:33.261
[engine revving]
[发动机转速]

19:33.348 --> 19:35.174
- Ha-ha.
- 哈哈。

19:35.261 --> 19:36.391
[laughs]
[笑]

19:36.478 --> 19:37.348
[grunts]
Ha!
[咕哝]
哈！

19:37.435 --> 19:39.521
- Ooh? Ahh.
- 哦？啊。

19:39.608 --> 19:40.607
Oh.
哦。

19:40.651 --> 19:41.564
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

19:41.651 --> 19:42.782
- [laughs]
- [笑]

19:42.869 --> 19:44.564
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

19:44.651 --> 19:46.087
- Hey there, ma'am.
- 嘿，女士。

19:46.174 --> 19:48.435
Is this beach taken?
这个海滩被占领了吗？

19:48.521 --> 19:50.043
- Oh, my.
- 哦，天哪。

19:50.130 --> 19:54.391
Eugene, you're so well-defined.
尤金，你的定义非常明确。

19:54.478 --> 19:55.478
Eugene?
尤金？

19:55.564 --> 19:57.608
[together]
Yeah! Ha-ha! Yeah!
[一起]
是啊！哈哈！是的！

19:57.695 --> 19:59.043
- Take a look.
- 看一下。

19:59.130 --> 20:02.174
These are called gains, people.
人们，这些被称为收益。

20:02.261 --> 20:02.912
Yeah.
是的。

20:03.000 --> 20:05.391
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

20:05.478 --> 20:07.869
- Hmm.
- 唔。

20:07.956 --> 20:09.435
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

20:09.521 --> 20:10.435
- Whoa!
- 哇！

20:10.521 --> 20:13.217
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

20:13.304 --> 20:14.217
- Ah!
- 啊！

20:14.304 --> 20:16.130
[grunts]
[咕哝]

20:16.217 --> 20:18.564
Nice pecs, Mr. Krabs.
蟹老板，胸肌不错。

20:18.651 --> 20:19.782
- We love you!
- 我们爱你！

20:19.869 --> 20:22.130
- Wow.
We love you.
- 哇。
我们爱你。

20:22.217 --> 20:24.695
- Strongest crab in the world!
- 世界上最强的螃蟹！

20:24.782 --> 20:26.738
I fear no man!
我不怕任何人！

20:26.825 --> 20:27.391
- [scoffs]
- [嘲笑]

20:27.478 --> 20:28.782
- Krabs!
- 螃蟹！

20:28.869 --> 20:29.868
[whistle blows]
[哨声响起]

20:29.912 --> 20:31.174
[all gasp]
- Larry?
[全都喘气]
- 拉里？

20:31.261 --> 20:32.695
[screams]
[尖叫声]

20:32.782 --> 20:35.521
- I'm going to crack you
right out of my shell, bro.
-我要打碎你
就在我的壳里，兄弟。

20:35.608 --> 20:36.607
- Whoa!
- 哇！

20:36.651 --> 20:38.608
Mr. Krabs, looking good!
蟹老板，看起来不错！

20:38.695 --> 20:40.782
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

20:40.869 --> 20:42.912
- Was that Larry?
- 那是拉里吗？

20:43.000 --> 20:45.608
He must have stopped working
out for a few minutes.
他一定已经停止工作了
出去几分钟。

20:45.695 --> 20:46.694
- Ahh!
- 啊！

20:46.738 --> 20:48.738
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

20:48.825 --> 20:51.435
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

20:51.521 --> 20:53.391
Fondue?
火锅？

20:53.478 --> 20:55.348
At the beach?
在海滩？

20:55.435 --> 20:56.130
Whoa!
哇！

20:56.217 --> 20:59.435
[groans] Oh, oh, oh, oh!
[呻吟]哦，哦，哦，哦！

20:59.521 --> 21:01.521
Whoa!
哇！

21:01.608 --> 21:03.651
Oh, oh, oh, oh!
哦，哦，哦，哦！

21:03.738 --> 21:04.825
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

21:04.912 --> 21:05.912
- Larry's in trouble.
- 拉里有麻烦了。

21:06.000 --> 21:07.521
- Someone save him!
- 谁来救救他！

21:07.608 --> 21:10.956
- Who will lifeguard
the lifeguards?
- 谁来担任救生员
救生员？

21:11.043 --> 21:12.608
- [whimpers] Huh?
- [呜咽] 嗯？

21:12.695 --> 21:14.956
Fondue Man!
火锅人！

21:15.043 --> 21:16.304
- Ah!
- Yeah!
- 啊！
- 是的！

21:16.391 --> 21:17.390
Yeah!
是的！

21:17.435 --> 21:18.695
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

21:18.782 --> 21:21.478
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

21:21.564 --> 21:22.695
Uh, OK.
呃，好吧。

21:22.782 --> 21:23.869
- Ouch!
- 哎呀！

21:23.956 --> 21:24.869
Whoa!
哇！

21:24.956 --> 21:25.869
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

21:25.956 --> 21:29.738
- Ahh!
- 啊！

21:29.825 --> 21:33.608
[gasping]
Ohh.
[喘气]
哦。

21:33.695 --> 21:36.000
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

21:36.087 --> 21:37.391
- Oh, yeah!
- 哦，是的！

21:37.478 --> 21:39.217
Ha-ha.
哈哈。

21:39.304 --> 21:41.391
That's right,
saving the day over here.
没错，
在这里拯救一天。

21:41.478 --> 21:43.174
What do you think of
me now, Puffykins?
你觉得怎么样
现在是我吗，普菲金斯？

21:43.261 --> 21:47.261
Your old Krabsy
is quite the hero.
你的老克拉布西
是相当的英雄。

21:47.348 --> 21:48.738
Hiyah!
嗨！

21:48.825 --> 21:50.391
- Oh, puh-lease.
- 哦，租借。

21:50.478 --> 21:53.304
I'm not into muscle-bound,
self-centered jerks.
我不喜欢肌肉发达，
以自我为中心的混蛋。

21:53.391 --> 21:54.521
- Heh-heh.
- 呵呵。

21:54.608 --> 21:56.521
What's that?
那是什么？

21:56.608 --> 21:58.651
- I like my boys a little
soft around the edges.
- 我有点喜欢我的男孩们
边缘柔软。

21:58.738 --> 21:59.651
- Oh.
- 哦。

21:59.738 --> 22:00.651
- Mwah.
- 哇。

22:00.738 --> 22:01.564
- Ah-ha-ha-ha.
- 啊哈哈哈。

22:01.651 --> 22:03.521
Hmm.
唔。

22:03.608 --> 22:05.411
- That's why Larry and I
have a beach date tomorrow.
- 这就是为什么拉里和我
明天去海滩约会。

22:05.435 --> 22:06.434
[laughs]
[笑]

22:06.478 --> 22:07.217
- Ha-ha!
- 哈哈！

22:07.304 --> 22:09.043
Larry loves beach dates.
拉里喜欢海滩约会。

22:09.130 --> 22:10.435
- Beach date?
- 海滩约会？

22:10.521 --> 22:11.782
Wait!
等待！

22:11.869 --> 22:13.130
I was kidding!
我开玩笑的！

22:13.217 --> 22:15.435
The muscles were just a ruse.
肌肉只是一个诡计。

22:15.521 --> 22:16.651
Puffy!
蓬松！

22:16.738 --> 22:17.956
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

22:18.043 --> 22:18.956
[all murmuring]
[大家窃窃私语]

22:19.043 --> 22:20.217
- [grunts] See!
- [咕哝]看！

22:20.304 --> 22:21.521
Ha-ha.
Oh.
哈哈。
哦。

22:21.608 --> 22:22.304
Ah!
啊!

22:22.391 --> 22:24.825
Puffykins, I'm soft.
普菲金斯，我很温柔。

22:24.912 --> 22:26.391
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]

- [抽泣]